# Shipmate: Specify

When preparing a technical specification from Jira, a local markdown document, or user intent:
1. Ground investigation in existing code, callers, and tests before asking questions.
2. Ask one material decision question at a time with concrete scenarios and trade-offs.
3. Review against specification personas before considering complete.
4. Follow the full procedure at `skills/specify/SKILL.md`.
